<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοικ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remove</i> one <i>from his home, eject, banish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξῴκισέν [με] γάμος οἴκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					948
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς εἰς Π̔ώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; <i>give notice to quit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1116.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. χρυσὸν τῆς Σπάρτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Arist.Cat.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			 and 
				Med.
			, <i>go from home, emigrate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροῦδοι . . εἰσιν ἐξῳκισμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					197
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξῳκίσαντο</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>; <i>quit a house</i> or <i>shop,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσοικ-,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.124
			</span></i>; <i>to be deported,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄλλην χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					929a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν πόλεμον τῆς Ἑλλάδος -ισμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ νόμου διὰ
				τὸν φόβον ἐξῳκίσθη</span>
			<i>was banished,</i> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Gorg.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dispeople, empty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῆμνον ἀρσένων ἐξῴκισαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					887
				</span></i>
			; <i>lay waste,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.77
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Comp.Ages.Pomp.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
